  'sections' => [
    ['Backend-Heavy vs. Frontend-Heavy Engineering Needs', 'Backend roles (Java, .NET, Python, Node.js) and frontend roles (React) draw from largely separate candidate pools, even on projects that need both. Adhiran typically staffs these as distinct hires rather than searching for rare full-stack generalists, since specialist depth usually outperforms generalist breadth on production systems.'],
