  'lead'  => 'A dedicated team differs from staff augmentation in one key way: it’s a self-contained unit that works exclusively on your projects, with its own internal structure, rather than individuals dropped into your existing team. Adhiran Infotech builds dedicated teams for companies who want offshore capacity without managing individual hires directly.',
